<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mbwera</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Mbwera</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mbwera</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mbwera</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mbwera</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu ashi sha mbwera shifunda luhala lwalufaa kwajili ya makaliru. Mana ya litawu lya shitabu ashi sha mbwera kwa Shieblaniya ndo “Muntu yakajojinira wantu.” Mfalumi Sulemani kalikala pakati pa vinja mia tisa sabini na mia tisa salasini na moja K.K, su itakulilwa kuwera shitabu ashi shilembitwi vinja avi, kumbiti wasomi wamonga wajimiliti kuwera ilembitwi na wafalumi wamu. Toziya luga yayitendiritwi iweriti ya wantumintumi kumbiti yawafalumi ndiri (mbwera 5:8-9). Wasomi wajimiranitindiri kuwera shitabu ashi sha mabweru shilembitwi vinja vivuwa shakapanu, pakati pa vinja mia nne na mia mbili K.K.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbwera kanja kwa kutakula handa kila shintu sha pasipanu. Ndo handa lyega lyalipita vumu na kwagamira kalongola. Shipandi sha kwanja mstali gwa pili. Ayi yana mana kuwera makaliru getu na lihengu lyetu ndo vintu vya katepu hera na ikamala kuvimana, kumbiti viraa ilanguziya ntambu yayiweriti ikamala kwa twenga kuvimana mirandu ayi. Mavuwa yagahusu makaliru na mahengu getu hagawaluwi shaka shifupi nentu. Mngati mwa shitabu ashi tulifunda kuwona handa gavuwa yagawusu makaliru na mahengu getu gawera kunja kwa uweza wa twenga wa kukolamlima mirandu. Handa ndo iherepa nentu. Su kuyijimira mirandu yoseri yayiwera na kuwera itosiya kulipanana nemeru kulawirana na virii hera vyatuwera navi shipandi sha tisa mstali gwa tisa. Shitabu ashi shimalira kwa kutakula mumakaliru kwana makamala na nemeru, shintu sha mana ndo kumguwira Mlungu na kujimira lagiru zakuyi. Shipandi sha kumi na mbili na mstali gwa kumi na tatu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ufupiziwu wa yagawera amu</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu sha mbwera shimmaniziya mlemba gwa shitabu na umani wakuyi umonga mumakaliru. Mstali gwa kwanja mpaka gwa kumi na moja mushipandi sha kwanja</para>
  <para style="io">Shitabu ashi shitakulira mana ya makaliru. Mushipandi sha kwanja mstali gwa kumi na mbili mpaka shipandi sha sita mstali gwa tisa.</para>
  <para style="io">Viravilii mfunda kalaviya mabeleziwu mu shipandi sha sita mstali gwa kumi mpaka shipandi sha kumi na mbili mstali gwa nani.</para>
  <para style="io">Kumguwira Mlungu na kukola lagiru zakuyi. Ipelera mushipandi sha kumi na mbili mstali gwa tisa mpaka gwa kumi na msheshi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Makaliru aga gahera mana yoseri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Avi ndo visoweru vya Mfunda, mwana gwa Dawudi na Dawudi kaweriti mfalumi gwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Mfunda kalonga hangu. “Shintundiri, shintundiri mumakaliru aga. Vyoseri vyavilawira vyahera mana.” <verse eid="ECC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Muntu hakapati shishi kulawirana na lihengu lyakuyi lyoseri lyakatabikiriti pasipanu? <verse eid="ECC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Viyiwuku viza na viyiwuku viwuka, kumbiti pasipanu hapalikali mashaka goseri. <verse eid="ECC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Mshenji gulawa na mshenji guzyeta na gutenda kalongola kuwuya kwagulawiti. <verse eid="ECC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Lyega livuma kugendera kushana na kugalambukira kusika, liwuyira mzyengetu gulagulii, shaka shoseri liwuyira njira yakuyi. <verse eid="ECC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Nshemba zoseri zinyinyilikira mashi gakuyi mubahali, kumbiti bahali nakaka imemandiri. Pahala nshemba kwazirawila, aku ndo kwaziwuya kayi. <verse eid="ECC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Mirandu yoseri imtenda muntu katoki, kuliku muntu ntambu yakaweza kutakula. Lisu litokandiri kulola na likutu lilekandiri kupikanira. <verse eid="ECC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Vyavilawiriti vinu havyendeleyi kulawira kayi, vyawatenditi wantu pamberi, wamonga hawavitendi, nakaka kwahera shintu sha syayi pasipanu. <verse eid="ECC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Wantu watakula, guloli, mlandu agu gwa syayi! Kumbiti gutendikiti kala kwanjira makashu. <verse eid="ECC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Kwahera muntu yanakaliholi mirandu yayilawiriti makashu, pota yagalawira.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umani wa Mfunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Neni Mfunda, weriti mfalumi gwa Israeli, aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Njeriti kulifunda kila shintu shashilawira pasipanu, kwa luhala nfiriti kwerewa mlandu agu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 1:13">Su nivimaniti kuwera Mlungu kawapananiti wantu lihengu likamala. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Niyiwona mirandu yoseri yayitendekiti pasipanu, shakapanu nivimaniti kuwera yoseri ayi yahera mana, ndo handa kuwinga lyega. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Mirandu yayiwerandiri teratera iwezandiri kunyawiwa kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 1:15">shashiwerandiri shiwezandiri kuwera.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Niliholiti namweni, “Guloli vinu luhala lwangu longereka kuliku wafalumi yawanongoleriti kukolamlima mu Yerusalemu pamberi paneni. Su nivimana vintu vivuwa kuliku ntambu yawatenditi womberi.” <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Shakapanu njeriti kuvimana luhala ntambu yaluwera na lukwali ntambu yaluwera na upungasesi ndambu yaluwera. Kumbiti nivimaniti kuwera kutenda hangu ndo kufira kuwinga lyega. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Mana luhala luvuwa lujega lyoga na umani pawongera ujega ntabiku.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Niliholiti namweni panonga, guleki njeri kulinoma na kulinemiziya. Kumbiti nyambuliti kuwera kutenda hangu ndo shintundiri. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Ntakula, kuseka shaka shoseri ndo uzigizigi. Hashi hatupati shishi kwa kulinemeziya? <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Njeriti kulanda ujimbi na kutenda mirandu ya uzigizigi, agawu mahala gangu gankali kunonguziya mu luhala. Nfiriti kuwona loshi ndo liherepa lyawafira kutenda wantu kwa mashaka madidiki gawalikala pasipanu.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Ntenditi mirandu mikulu. Nilinyawiriti numba nkulu na kulilimira malambu ga mizabibu. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Nyawiti bostani na kuyala mitera ya mabwajubwaju ga kila ntambu. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Mbawiti matanda ga mashi ga kwitilira mitera ayi. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Hemiriti wamanda wapalu na wadala na wamanda wamonga wiwuka mnumba mwangu. Viraa weriti na ulunda uvuwa wa vipinga vya ng'ombi, kondolu na mbuzi kuliku wakolamlima yawanongoleriti kulikala Yerusalemu pamberi pa neni. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Nilijojoniriti mpiya na zaabu, kulawa hanja za wafalumi na kulawa muisi zimonga. Weriti na wimbaji wapalu na wadala, viraa weriti na wadala wa kunja yawampanana nemeru nkulu.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Manikiti nentu, kuliku wakolamlima woseri yawalongoleriti kulikala Yerusalemu pamberi paneni, mu goseri aga weriti nanaluhala nentu. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Kila shintu shanishifiriti nishipatiti. Toziya moyu gwangu nigwimitindiri nemeru yoseri na gweni gunemeliliti mahengu gangu na alii, ndo lifupu lya lihengu lyangu. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Shakapanu nigaholiti goseri yanigatenditi na ntambu yantabikiti kugatenda aga. Panu nivimaniti kuwera goseri ndo shintundiri nakamu, ndo teratera na kutugiziya liyega, na kwahera mota yoseri pasipanu. <verse eid="ECC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Shakapanu nanja kulihola mana ya kuwera na luhala, lukwali na uzigizigi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 2:12">Shintu gaa mfalumi yakiza kaweza kutenda sheni hashenitendwi? <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Su, Mona handa luhala ndo luherepa kuliku uzigizigi, gambira ulangala ntambu yauherepa kuliku luwindu. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Muntu yakana luhala kawona kwakagenda, kumbiti mzigizigi katyanga muluwindu. Su nivimana kuwera woseri wawili awa upeleru wawu ndo umuhera. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Shakapanu nilihola mumoyu mwangu, “Yagafira kumpata mzigizigi hagampati naneni. Ntambu gaa wera na luhala loseri alu?” “Ntakula mumoyu mwangu,” “Ali viraa lyahera mana.” <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Toziya kwahera muntu yakanamuholi yakana luhala ama mzigizigi. Mana mashaka yagiza woseri hawalyaluwiki. Ntambu yakahowa yakana luhala na mzigizigi hakahowi ntambuiraa. <verse eid="ECC 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Hangu, nagakalalira makaliru aga, toziya goseri yagatendeka pasipanu gahinginiziya. Goseri shintundiri nakamu, ndo handa kutugiziya liyega.<verse eid="ECC 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Nkalaliriti lihengu lyangu lyoseri lyantenditi pasipanu, toziya nfiruwitwi nimlekeri mkolalimlima yakiza. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Gaa yakavimana kuwera muntu ayu hakaweri na luhala ama mzigizigi? Hangu yomberi ndo hakakolimlima vyoseri vyantenditi kwa luhala pasipanu. Ali viraa ndo shintundiri nakamu. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Su, moyu gwangu gutwezukiti kwa lihengu lyangu lyoseri lyantediti kwa ntabiku pasipanu. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Mana, shaka shimonga muntu katenda lihengu kwa kutendera luhala, mahala na umani wakuyi, shakapanu kamlekera muntu gwingi kanemeleri mota ya lihengu lyeni kalitendandiri. Aga na geni gahera mana. Ndo mlandu yagutabisiya. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Muntu hakapati shishi kwa lihengu lyakatenditi kwa ntabiku nentu pasipanu? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Toziya makaliru gakuyi goseri gamema ntabiku na lihengu lyakuyi ndo magaziya, na pashiru mahala gakuyi goyerandiri. Aga na geni gahera mana.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Shintu shiherepa kwa muntu, ndo kuliya na kulanda na kulinemelera lihengu lyakuyi. Ali nalyeni niliwona lilawa kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Gaa yakaweza kuliya na kunemelera, pota Mlungu? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Muntu ulii yakamfiriziya Mlungu, Mlungu kampanana luhala, umani na nemeru, ila yakana vidoda Mlungu kampanana lihengu lya kujojonira na kutula ulunda su Mlungu kampanani ulii yakamfira. Ali na lyeni viraa shintundiri, ndo handa kutugiziya liyega.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Kila shintu shana shaka shakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Kila shintu shilawira kwa shaka shakuyi pasipanu.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Shaka sha kwiwuka na shaka sha kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:2">shaka sha kuyala na shaka sha kubenanga,<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />shaka sha kulaga wantu na shaka kuponiziya wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:3">shaka sha kubomola na shaka sha kunyawa,<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />Viraa kwana shaka sha kulira na shaka sha kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:4">shaka sha kudaya na shaka sha kuvina,<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Kayi kwana shaka sha kwasa mabuhi na shaka sha kugajojonira mabuhi na kugatendera kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:5">shaka sha kukisikira na shaka sha kuleka kukisikira.<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Viraa kwana shaka sha kusakula na shaka sha kwagamiziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:6">shaka sha kutula weri na shaka sha kwasa,<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />kayi kwana shaka sha kupapula na shaka sha kusona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:7">shaka sha kunyamala na shaka sha kuyowera,<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />Ntambu iraa kwana shaka sha kufira na shaka sha kulema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:8">shaka sha nkondu na shaka sha ponga.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Mtenda lihengu hakapati shishi kulawirana na lihengu lyakuyi? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Neni mona lihengu likamala lyeni Mlungu kampanana muntu, su katabiki. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Mlungu kashitenda kila shintu shiweri shiherepa kwa shaka shakuyi. Kampanana muntu kavimani mirandu ayi shaka shoseri, kumbiti kwahera muntu yakavimana shakashitenda Mlungu kulawa kwanja mpaka upeleru. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Nivimana kuwera kwa muntu, kwana mlandu gumu hera, gweni ndo kunemelera na kutenda maheri shaka shoseri shakalikala. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Twawoseri twenga tufiruwa kuliya na kulanda na kunemelera galii gatugapata. Aga ndo mafiru ga Mlungu.<verse eid="ECC 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Nivimana handa shoseri shakatenda Mlungu hashilikali mashaka goseri. Kwahera shashiweza kongerwa ama kupungulwa, Mlungu katenda hangu su wantu wamguwiri yomberi. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Shintu shoseri shashilawira vinu, shilawiritikala na shanashilawiri shakapanu shilawiritikala. Mlungu katenda kila shintu shilawiri kayi.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu watendandiri ntambu yayifiruwa pasipanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Viraa, moniti shintu shimonga pasipanu, sheni ndo, pamahakama ukontola ukolamlima, na pahala pa kulaviya shilii shashifiruwa, ukontola ukolamlima. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Su, nilihola mumoyu mwangu, “Mlungu hakawatozi woseri yawatenda yagafiruwa na wakontola, toziya hakuweri na shaka kwa kila mlandu na shaka kwa kila lihengu.” <verse eid="ECC 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Viravirii nilitakulira mumoyu mwangu, kuwera Mlungu kawatenda wantu wavimani kuwera womberi ndo handa wankanyama, ndo mana kawajera. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Upeleru wa muntu ndo handa wa nkanyama. Ntambu yakahowa muntu ndo ntambu yakahowa nkanyama. Woseri wapumula ntambu yimu, muntu kahera mana kuliku nkanyama. Goseri ndo shintundiri. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Woseri wahowa na wagenda pahala pamuhera. Woseri walawa mulidikudiku na hawawuyi mulidikudiku. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Gaa yakavimana, handa rohu ya muntu ikwena kulyera ama pambindi na rohu ya nkanyama igenda pasi palitapaka? <verse eid="ECC 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Hangu mona handa kwahera mrandu yaguherepa nentu kwa muntu, ira kunemelera mahengu gakuyi, toziya aga ndo gakapangiwa. Su gaa yakaweza kumuwuziya kayi kawoni yagafira kulawira shaka pakahowa.<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Shakapanu mona wantu pawatabisiwa pasipanu. Viraa mona masozi ga wantu yawatabisiwa na kwahera ata muntu gwakuwazyangazyanga, mana walii yawawatabisiya wana makakala nentu. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Nilihola mumoyu kuwera mbaka wantu yawahowiti kuliku walii yawawera wakomu. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Mbaka muntu yakiwukitindiri kuliku wawili awa, toziya mweni hakewoni ukontola ulii yawutendeka pasipanu.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Kayi moniti kuwera mahengu goseri na mpatiru zoseri zirawirana na mashindanu ga mpatiru pakati pa wapakwegera. Ashi na sheni shintundiri, ndo handa kutugiziya liyega <verse eid="ECC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Mzigizigi katendandiri lihengu na upeleru wakuyi kaliraga kwa njala. <verse eid="ECC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Mbaka kuwera na shididini na ponga mumoyu, kuliku kuwera na vivuwa vyana ntabiku. Ayi viraa ndo teratera na kutugiziya liyega.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Kayi, moniti mlandu gumonga yagwahera mana nakamu pasipanu. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Kuweriti na muntu yakaweriti gweka yakuyi, kaweritindiri na mwana ama mlongu, katenditi lihengu kila lishaka na katosiwandiri na ulunda wakaweriti nawu. Pota kulikosiya, nilitabisiyiti hangu toziya ya gaa na neni ntambu gaa sinda kunemelera? Ashi na sheni ndo shintundiri, ndo lihengu lyana ntabiku.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Mbaka wantu wawili yawatenda lihengu pamuhera kuliku muntu gwekayakuyi. Toziya hawalitangi kutenda lihengu weri. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Handa yumu pakaguwa, myaguwi hakamgolusiyi. Kumbiti ndo mlandu gwa kuhinginiziya muntu pakaguwa pakawera gwekayakuyi na kahera gwa kumgolosiya. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Viraa, wantu wawili pawagonja pamuhera hawahemuki, kumbiti muntu pakawera gweka yakuyi hakahemuki hashi? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Mnkondu kaweza kumkanka muntu pakawera gweka yakuyi, kumbiti pawawera wawili waweza kumkomanga mnkondu na kumkanka. Handa ngoyi ntatu pazipotwa pamuhera hapeni zidumuki kalongola.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Mbaka mntemba mhushu yakana luhala kuliku mfalumi mzewi mzigizigi, mweni kapikinirandiri shiheri shakagambirwa, <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />ata payiwera mntemba ayu kiwukitindiri mukaya ya shifalumi ama kaweriti mtatirwa na mhushu kaweza kuwera mfalumi. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Niwawoniti wantu woseri yawalika pasipanu, wamfatiti mntemba ayu yakaweriti ufalumi. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Wantu yakawakolitimlima waweriti wavuwa nentu. Na yomberi kawakolitimlima woseri Ata, walii yanawiwuki pamberi hapeni wamnemeleri. Ashi viraa shintundiri, ndo handa kutugiziya lyega.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Naguleka kutenda shilii shagulongiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Guliloleri weri pagugenda kunumba Nkulu Nanagala ya Mlungu. Mbaka kulifunda kuliku kulaviya tambiku handa wazigizigi ntambu yawalaviya tambiku, wantu yawavimanandiri kuwera wankutenda madoda. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Nagutakula visoweru vya uzigizigi, pota moyu gwaku kugutenda kalongola kutakula kulongolu kwa Mlungu, mana Mlungu kakumpindi nagwenga gwa pasipanu. Hangu visoweru vyaku viweri vididini. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Kulota kwiza pagwana mahengu gavuwa, viravirii visoweru vya mzigizigi shaka pakayowera nentu. <verse eid="ECC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Pagutakula shintu kwa Mlungu, nagukawalira kushitenda, toziya Mlungu kafiliziwandiri na wazigizigi. Gutendi shagulongiti. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Mbaka nagutakula kuliku kutakula pota kutenda. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Nagutakula shintu shanashikutendi gutendi vidoda, viraa nagumgambira mtambika gwa Mlungu handa, ntakuliti pota kufira. Aga hagamtendi Mlungu kaweri na maya na gwenga na kulihalibisiya lihengu lyaku lyoseri lyagutenditi. <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Handa pagulota nentu ama paguyowera visoweru vivuwa, avi vya manandiri. Shintu sha mana ndo kumpanana ligoya Mlungu na kumjimira.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaliru ga pasipanu gahera mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Nagulikangasha paguwona wantu wahushu wankuyonerwa mu isi, toza na haki pavigalambulwa. Mana mkulu yumu kajimira shirii shakagambiritwi na gwa kumpindi gwakuyi nentu.<verse eid="ECC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Mpatiru ya isi ndo kwa wantu woseri, ata mfalumi mweni kaliya vyavilawa mumalambu.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Muntu yakafira mpiya katoshekanazindiri na yakafira ulunda hapeni kaweri na nemeru. Na ashi viraa ndo shintundiri. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Lunda payongereka na yawaliya wongereka. Kumbiti lunda hapayimtangi muntu yakana ulunda, su hakayiloli na upeleru wakuyi hayagamiri kalongola. <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Shibaluwa kagonja mpota zinoga, ata pakaliya shididini ama shivuwa. Kumbiti ulunda uvuwa umwima mpota mlunda.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Kayi moniti mlandu gumonga mkontola nentu pasipanu. Muntu kalimamatiliti lunda na yeni imtangandiri shaka sha ntabiku. <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />Shintu shidoda pashilawira, na kuyitenda lunda ayi yagamiri, upeleru wakuyi, Kahera mpiya yoseri yayisigaliti kwa mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Muntu kiwuka pota shintu shoseri, ntambu yakiziti ndo hakawuyi ntambu iraa. Hapeni katoli shoseri shashilawa mulihengu lyakuyi. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Mlandu agu viraa guhinginiziya, mana muntu hakawuyi ntambu yakiziti. Nayomberi hakapati shishi kwa kutenda lihengu lyoseri. Mlandu agu ndo teratera na kutugiziya lyega? <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Makaliru goseri ga mlunda gaweriti ntabiku, kwinginika, magaziwu, malweri na maya.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Kumbiti, nivimaniti kuwera mbaka muntu kuliya na kulanda na kunemelera lihengu lyakuyi likamala lyakatenditi pasipanu mumashaka madidini gakapananwiti na Mlungu, mana ashi ndo shakafiruwitwi kupananwa. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Handa Mlungu kampanana muntu ulunda na vintu vitangala na kamtenda kavinemeleri na kulonga mayagaashii kulawa mulihengu lyakuyi likamala. Mana aga ndo mafupu kulawa kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Toziya Mlungu kamtenda muntu kaweri na nemeru, su muntu hapeni kaweri na lyoga mumakaliru gakuyi madidini.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Mona mlandu gumonga mkontola pasipanu, gweni guwatabisiya nentu wantu. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Mlungu kampanana muntu ulunda, vintu vitangala na ligoya, su nakapungulwa na shintu shoseri shakafira, kumbiti kampananandiri uwezu wa kuvinemelera vintu avi. Ila, mhenga ndo hakavinemeleri vintu avi. Ali viraa ndo shintundiri nakamu, ndo mlandu gwa ntabiku nentu. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Muntu kaweza kulera wana wavuwa na kulikala mashaka gavuwa, tembera muntu ayu kalikala makaliru gatangala, kumbiti mumakaliru gakuyi kanemeleritindiri na pakahowa kafintirwandiri kwa ukulu, ntakula hangu, mbaka mwana yakiwukiti agawu kahowa kuliku muntu ayu. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />Mwana yakahowiriti mumtima kwiwuka kwakuyi kwahera mana, toziya hapakaweri na litawu, kagamira kuluwindu na kulyaluwika. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Tembera mwana ayu kenewoni mshenji pota kuvimana shoseri, yomberi koyera kuliku mlunda ayu. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Tembera muntu ayu hakalikali vinja elufu mbili nentu, kumbiti kanemelerandiri mpatiru zakuyi, hashi woseri hapawagendi pahala pamu?<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Muntu katenda lihengu kwa makakala iri kapati shiboga, kumbiti matamata yakuyi ya kuliya iperandiri. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Muntu yakana luhala kawera mbaka nentu kuliku mzigizigi? Na muntu mhushu kapata mota gaa pakavimana ntambu ya kulikala weri na wantu? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Avi viraa ndo shintundiri, ndo teratera na kufira kubata lyega. Mbaka kunemelera shintu shaguwera nashi kuliku kuligaziya kwa kufira shintu shimonga.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Kila shintu shashilawira shipangitwi kala makashu na ntambu ya muntu imanikana na kwahera muntu yakaweza kusingana na muntu yakana likakala kuliku yomberi. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Visoweru paviwera vivuwa, vyahera mana. Su muntu hakapati mota gaa kwa visoweru vivuwa? <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Gaa yakavimana mirandu gaa hayimtangi muntu mumakaliru aga madidini yagawerandiri na mota na yagapita handa lisisi? Gaa yakaweza kumgambira yagafira kulawira pasipanu pa yomberi kuhowa?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Maholu ga utanga mumakaliru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Mbaka litawu liheri kuliku utuli wa beyi nkulu na lishaka lya kuhowa kuliku lishaka lya kwiwuka.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Mbaka kugenda kushiwembu, kuliku kugenda kumsambu, toziya kuhowa ndo upeleru wa kila muntu, su yawawera wakomu wafiruwa kulitula ali mumiyoyu mwawu.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Mbaka kwinginika kuliku kuseka, toziya tulifunda nentu patuwera na hinginiku.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Wantu yawanaluhala wawera munumba yana shiwembu, kumbiti wazigizigi wawera munumba ya msambu.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Mbaka kupikila maberiziya ga wana luhala kuliku kupikinira nyimbu za wazigizigi.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kuseka kwa wazigizigi ndo handa liziwu lya misontu mumotu. Ashi viraa ndo shintundiri.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Kuzyanga kumtenda muntu yakana luhala kuwera mzigizigi. Kwanka swinda kuhalibisiya moyu.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Upeleru wa mlandu ndo mbaka kuliku mwanjiru gwakuyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 7:8">Uhepeleru ndo uherepa kuliku kulitumba.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Naguyewuka kuwera na maya, mana maya ilikala kwa wazigizigi.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Nagutakula, hashi mashaka ga makashu gaweriti gaherepa kuliku mashaka ga vinu? Mana kukosiya hangu luhalandiri.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Luhala ndo luhelepa handa uhala, toziya lwana mota kwa walii woseri yawawera wakomu. <verse eid="ECC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Luhala lulolera handa mpiya ntambu yayitulolera. Kumbiti mota ya umani ndo ayi, luhala lulolela ukomu wa muntu yakawera nalu.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Guliholi weri lihengu lya Mlungu. Gaa yakaweza kushitula weri shakashipinditi Mlungu? <verse eid="ECC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Mumashaka ga mbatiru gunemeleri, kumbiti mumashaka ga ntabiku guliholi aga, mbatiru na ntabiku. Toziya Mlungu kagatenda goseri aga gaweri pamuhera. Su muntu nakavimana shintu shoseri kuusu makaliru gakuyi gagiza.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Mumakaliru gangu yagahera mana, mona mirandu ayi miwili, muntu mheri kahowa kalongola tembera ndo mheri na muntu mkontola kendeleya kulikala makaliru matali muukontola wakuyi. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Naguwera gwa mheri nentu, pota naguwera gwana luhala nentu. Hashi gufira kulilaga gamweni? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Kumbiti naguwera mukontola nentu, ama naguwera mzigizigi, ntambu gaa gufira kuhowa pamberi pa shaka shaku? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Mbaka gugakoli goseri aga, mana yakamjimira Mlungu hakaweri na mpatiru.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Luhala lumtenda muntu kuwera na likakala nentu kuliku wakolamlima kumi mu mji.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Kwahera muntu yakatenda yagafiruwa pasipanu yakatenda aga mashaka goseri pota kutenda vidoda.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Nagupikinira visoweru vyoseri vyawalonga wantu, nagwiza kumpikanira ntumintumi gwaku pakakupangira. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Mana gamweni guvimana mumoyu handa mala zivuwa guwapangira wantu.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Goseri aga nigajeriti kwa luhala, pantakula nfira kuwera yakana luhala. Kumbiti luhala luweriti kutali naneni. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Muntu hapakawezi kuvimana mana ya mirandu ayi? Mlandu agu gukamala nentu kugumana. <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Ata hangu nkazaniti kuvimana na kulolalola na kusakula luhala na mana ya mirandu ayi na viraa kuvimana ukontola ndo upungasesi na uzigizigi ndo lukwali.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Mona mlandu gumu gwagukamala kuliku kuhowa, gwa mdala yakawera handa mgomiziwu, toziya ufiru ndo handa wavu wa kuyambira na mawoku gakuyi ndo minyololu. Su muntu yakamfiriziya Mlungu kamshapira mdala ayu, kumbiti yakana vidoda kagomiziwa na yomberi. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Mfunda katakula, aga ndo ganigamaniti, pantenditi ulolalola shididini. <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Nendeleyiti kusakula milandu ayi, kumbiti mpatitindiri. Pakati pa wapalu elufu yimu, nimpatiti mpalu yumu, yakana ligoya, kumbiti pakati pa wadala elufu yimu nimwonandiri ata yumu yakana ligoya. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Na nilifunda mlandu gumu, Kuwera Mlungu kamwumbiti muntu mheri, kumbiti muntu kasyagula njira yakuyi mweni.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Gaa yakawera handa yakana luhala? Gaa yakavimana mirandu ntambu yaviwera? Luhala lumjegera muntu kuseka na lugalambula sheni sha muntu yakana hinginika.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumjimira mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Nikugambira gujimiri lagalira ya mfalumi, toziya gulilapiti kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Naguwuka kalongola kulongolu kwa mfalumi, pota nagwendeleya kutenda madoda, mana mfalumi hakatendi ntambu yakafira. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Mana lagalira ya mfalumi ndo litakulu lya upeleru, kwahera yakaweza kumkosiya, “Ntambu gaa gwankutenda hangu?” <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Handa pagujimira lagiru lyakuyi hapeni gupati madoda na yakana luhala hakavimani shaka shashifiruwa kutenda shintu. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Kila shintu shana shaka shakuyi na njira yakuyi, ata hangu ntabiku impata muntu. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Kwahera yakavimana mashaka gagiza, na kwahera yakaweza kumgambira lyanalizi? <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Kwahera muntu yakawera na uwezu wa kulewelera rohu naifuwa, viraa kwahera muntu yakana uwezu wa kulewelera lishaka lyakuyi lya kuhowa. Viraavilii lishonta liwezandiri kuwuya kumberi lishaka lya nkondu na ukontola uwezandiri kumlopola mkontola shaka sha kuhowa.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wakontola na wantu waheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Goseri aga nigawona paweriti nankulihola kuusu yagatendeka pasipanu, kweni kwana muntu kakolamlima wayaguyi na kuwatabisiya. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Viravirii, niwawona wakontola pawafintirwa kwa ligoya, wantu weni wazoleriti kwingira na kulawa pahala pakuguwira na waweriti wankuzyumwa mumji gulagulii gwawaweriti watenda makontola gawu. Ali viraa ndo shintundiri.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Handa toza yizandiri kalongola kwa wakontola, su miyoyu ya wantu haifiri kutenda madoda. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Tembera yawana vidoda watenda makontola mala zivuwa, kumbiti wendeleya kulikala. Hangu meyiweri mbaka kwawomberi yawamguwira Mlungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Kumbiti wantu wakontola hapawaweri na mpatiru, mana womberi hapawaweri na makaliru matali toziya wamguwirandiri Mlungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Kwana mlandu gumu gwagutendeka pasipanu. Gweni ndo wantu waheri watenderwa makontola na wakontola watenderwa maheri, agu viraa gwahera mana.<verse eid="ECC 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Hangu, neni nilihola kuwera mbaka kunemera makaliru, toziya shintu shana mana kwa muntu pasipanu ndo kuliya na kulanda na kunemelera. Shakapanu nemeru hayigendi pamuhera na yomberi mulihengu lyakuyi mashaka goseri ga makaliru gakuyi gakapananitwi na Mlungu pasipanu.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Panjeriti kuvimana luhala na kuwona yagalawira pasipanu, nyambuliti kuwera guweza kulikala pota kugonja paluwala na pashiru, <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />shakapanu moniti goseri galii Mlungu kagagatenditi. Kwahera muntu yoseri yakaweza kuvimana goseri yagatendeka pasipanu. Ata muntu pakajera ntambu gaa kusakula, muntu hapeni kawezi kuvimana mana yakuyi. Ata muntu yakana luhala pakalitenda kavimana, nakaka hapeni kawezi kuvimana.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Hangu niliholiti goseri aga, mona handa Mlungu kalonguziya matendu ga wantu yawana luhala na wamika, kwahera muntu yoseri yakaweza kuvimana yagawera kulongolu. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Woseri awa wana upeleru wumu, mwaminika na mkontola, mheri na mdoda, yakaherepa na mhumba, yawalaviya malaviwu na yawalaviyandiri. Ntambu yayiwera kwa mheri ndo ntambu yayiwera kwa yakana vidoda na ntambu yayiwera kwa yawalirapa ndo hayiweri kwa yawalirapandiri. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Agu ndo mlandu gudoda nentu pakati pa goseri yagatendeka pasipanu, upeleru ulauli uwapata wantu woseri. Kayi, shaka shoseri sha makaliru gawu, wantu wamema ukontola na lukwali, shakapanu wahowa. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Kumbiti yakawera pamuhera na yawawera wakomu kana litumbiru, mbaka ng'ang'a mkomu kuliku simba yakahowa. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Mana, wakomu wavimana handa hawahowi, kumbiti yawahowiti wavimanandiri shintu. Wahera sha mana na womberi walilyaluwika nakamu. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Ufiru wawu, nkalaliru zawu na matamata zawu, vyoseri viwuka na womberi, su hapeniwashitendi kayi shintu shoseri pasipanu.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Gugendi gwakaliyi shiboga shaku kwa nemeru na gwakalandi divayi yaku kwa nemeru, mana Mlungu kajimira shagutenda. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Mashaka goseri guvali nguwu iherepa na guliswagi lipaki kumtuyi. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Makaliru ndo madidi, gunemeleri pamuhera na mdala gwaku yagumfira shaka shoseri sha makaliru gaku, Mana ashi ndo shagupangiritwi na Mlungu mumakaliru gaku na lihengu lyaku lya ntabiku pasipanu. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Kila shintu shagufira kushitenda gushitendi kwa makakala gaku goseri, mana kumambi aku kwagugenda kwahera kutenda lihengu pota shoseri shirii pota umani ama luhala.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Kayi, mona shintu shimonga pasipanu, handa yawadaha kutuga wakankandiri kwa kutuga kwawu, pota wamashonta hapeni wakanki nkondu na yawana luhala hapeni wapati shiboga na yawana mahala hapeni walundi, pota yawana umani wapatandiri ukulu, kumbiti shaka sha mpatiru shiwapati woseri. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Muntu kashimanandiri shaka shakuyi hashisokindii. Handa wasomba ntambu yawagomera muwavu pota kuvimana na handa wampongu ntambu yawagomera mumgomiziwu, hangu ndo madoda ntambu yagawapata wantu pota kuvimana.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala luherepa kuliku uzigizigi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Viravirii mona shintu shakashitenditi muntu yakana luhala shihelepiziyiti nentu. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Paweriti na mji gumu mdidini gwana wantu wadidini. Mfalumi yakana likakala kagukankaliti na katuliti mashonta wakuyi su kagukomangi. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />Mumji agu, kuweriti na mhushu yumu yakana luhala, mweni kwa luhala lwakuyi kagulopola mji agu. Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakamholiti mhushu ayu. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Su neni ntakula, luhala ndo luherepa kuliku likakala, kumbiti luhala lwa mhushu lubeziwa na kwahera yakapikanira visoweru vyakuyi. <verse eid="ECC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Mbaka kupikinira visoweru vyampolimpoli vya muntu yakana luhala, kuliku kupikira umatu wa mfalumi kushikawu sha wazigizigi. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Kuwera na luhala ndo kuherepa kuliku vintu vya kulikomangira vya nkondu, kumbiti yakana vidoda yumu kahalibisiya maherepa gavuwa.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Handa wavinkozi yawafuwiriti musupa ya utuli kutenda ununki, viravirii uzigizigi mdidini guhalibisiya luhala na ligoya.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Moyu gwa yakana luhala gumulonguziya kutenda yagafiruwa, Kumbiti muntu mzigizigi moyu gwakuyi gumlongoziyandiri katendi maheri. <verse eid="ECC 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Muntu mzigizigi pakatyanga munjira, kalanguziya ungalimahala wakuyi na katenda kila muntu kammani yomberi ndo mzigizigi.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Mkolamlima pakakukalalira naguleka lihengu lyaku, makosa gavuwa gaweza kuwusiwa kwa kulinanagaziya.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Moniti ukontola pasipanu, weni mkolamlima kawutenditi. <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Wakolamlima wawapanana wazigizigi lihengu lya ukulu na walunda watola mpenu za pasi. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Neni mona wamanda wakwena falasi na wakulu wankugendagenda kwa magulu handa wamanda.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Yakabawa lirindi hakawezi kupatukira mweni na yakabomola shibambaza hakawezi kulumwa na njoka. <verse eid="ECC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Mpanda mabuwi kaweza kutenduwa na geni, yakasalanga mbawu ziweza kumtenda. <verse eid="ECC 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Handa liwagu lyaku palikolandiri, hayiweri ikamala kulitendera na paguwera na luhala haguvimani ntambu ya kutenda. <verse eid="ECC 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Muntu kaweza kumana mgota gwa kumtenda njoka kanyamali, kumbiti njoka pakaluma muntu mgota agu gwahera mana. <verse eid="ECC 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Visoweru vya yakana luhala vimtenda wantu wampanani ligoya, kumbiti visoweru vya mzigizigi vimwagamiziya mweni. <verse eid="ECC 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Mzigizigi kanja kutakula visoweru vya ungalimahala na upeleru wa visoweru vyakuyi ndo lukwali. <verse eid="ECC 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Mzigizigi kalekandiri kutakula. Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakavimana yagafira kulawira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 10:14">kwahera yanakafiri kutugambila yanagalawiri patuhowaku<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Mzigizigi katenda lihengu na kutoka nentu, ata kavimanandiri njira ya kuwuya ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Wantu hawaweri muntabiku payiwera mkolamlima gwakuyi mntemba mzigizigi, viravirii walonguziya wakuyi hawafiri msambu kila lishaka. <verse eid="ECC 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Itekelerwa isi yeni, mkolamlima gwakuyi kalawa kaya yayipananwa ligoya na walonguziya wakuyi watenda msambu shaka shashifaa, kwajili ya kupata likakala na toziyandiri ya kulowera.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Handa muntu pakawera mleli shitwiku sha numba hashing'ong'onali na kwa uleli wakuyi kayitenda numba yakuyi isumi.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Msambu gwa shiboga na divayi vitutenda tukalamuki na kuwera na nemeru, kumbiti gufiruwa kuwera na mpiya su kuhemera vyoseri avi.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Nagumlonga mfalumi ata mumaholu gaku, ama kumpangira mlunda mushumba shaku sha kugonja, toziya wampongu wa kuliyera waweza kutola visoweru vyaku na mpongu yakaguluka kaweza kubwera visoweru vyaku vyagutakuliti.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Ntambu yakatenda yakana luhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Guwapanani wantu vintu vyaku kwa moyu gwa kufira, handa pagutenda hangu lishaka limu haguwuzilirwi. <verse eid="ECC 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Guwapanani wantu saba ama nani vintu vyaguweranavi, toziya guvimanindiri lishaka lya ntabiku ntambu yalyanakupati.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Mawundi pagamema mashi, mvula itowa muisi. Mtera paguguwira kusika ama kushana, paguguwiriti hagugonjeri palaa. <verse eid="ECC 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Yakahepera lyega hapeni kayali mbeyu, yakahepera mawundi gagamili, hapeni kabenangi shintu. <verse eid="ECC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Ntambu yaguvimanandiri njira ya lyega ama nshimba ntambu yayiwumbwa mngati mwa mtima gwa mawu, ntambu iraa guvimanandiri lihengu lya Mlungu, mnyawa gwa vintu vyoseri. <verse eid="ECC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Guyali mbeyu mandawira na pashimihi naguleka kuyala, mana guvimanandiri hazimeri zyoshi, zya mandawira ama zya pashimihi ama zoseri haziweri ziherepa.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Kulangala kuwatenda wantu wanemeleri. Nakugulola mshenji gwa mandawira gufiriziya. <verse eid="ECC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Muntu pakalikala vinja vivuwa na kavinemeleri vinja vyoseri avi, kumbiti kaliholi kuwera mashaka gakuyi hagaweri gatangala na goseri yakafata hagaheri mana.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magambiziya kwa wantemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Gwee mntemba, gunemeleri untemba waku, moyu gwaku gukalamki shaka gwankali mntemba. Goseri gagugawona na kugafira gugatendi. Kumbiti guliholi kuwera Mlungu hakakutozi kwa goseri aga gagutenda.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Su naguwera na lyoga mumoyu mwaku na gwasiri kutali magaziwu ga nshimba yaku, toziya untemba na makakala shintundiri.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Guholi kumtendera Mlungu gwaku mashaka ga untemba waku, pamberi pa kwiza mashaka ga ntabiku, pota havyenisegeleri vinja pagulonga, nahera nemeru mu makaliru. <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Paguwera mzewi, na kusinda kuwona langala lya mshenji, hapeni guwezi kuwona langala lya lyezi na ntondu, mashaka goseri hagaweri luwindu pa mvula kutowa. <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />Shaka mawoku gaku yagakulolera hagalendemeri na magulu gaku hagawerindiri na makakala. Haguweri na menu madidini ga kuliyira na masu gaku hagasindi kulola. <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Shaka makutu gaku hapeni gapikaniri liziwu lya mji na hapeni gupikaniri liziwu lya watenda lihengu, hapeni gupikaniri liziwu lya wimba, kumbiti maziwu ga wampongu hagakwimusiyi. <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Shaka ashi hagutili kukwena muvigongu na hagutiri atari za munjira, na haguweri na neziwu, hapaguwezi kugendagenda gamweni handa shibatala mzewi. Hapeni guwafiri kayi wadala, upeleru waku haguhowi na kufintirwa, wantu hawakudayiri. <verse eid="ECC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Guholi kumtendera Mlungu gwaku shaka gwankali mntemba, mana lishaka limu hagusoki pawupeleru na lishaka ali haguweri handa kudumuka kwa mkufu gwa madini ga feza, ama kupantika kwa bakuli ya zaabu, ama kupantika kwa vulu kulinegu na handa kudumuka kwa lugoyi. <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Nshimba hayiwuyi mlitapaka handa lidikudiku na rohu hayimwuyili Mlungu yakayiwumbiti.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Neni mfunda nonga hangu, “Vyoseri avi vyahera mana! Kila shintu shahera mana!”<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Visoweru vya upeleru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Mfunda kaweritindiri hera na luhala, ira kawapananiti viraa wantu umani. Kaziholiti na kulolalola na kuzitula mumalembu matakulu gavuwa. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Mfunda kakazaniti kusakula visoweru vyavifiruwa na kila shakashilembiti shiweriti sha teratera na nakaka. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Visoweru vya wantu yawana luhala ndo handa luhonga lwalusongokiti lwa kuwalonguziya wankanyama na ulagilagi wawu ndo handa misumali yayikomilitwi mu shipandi sha mbawu na kukamalira, hangu ayu ndo Mlungu yakatupananiti ulagilagi awu twenga.<verse eid="ECC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Nentu ya aga mwana gwangu, gujimiri maberiziwu. Mana kulemba vitabu kwahera upeleru na kusoma nentu kutokiziya nshimba.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Lyalifiruwa kwa goseri aga ndo, gumtiri na gumjimiri Mlungu na guzikola lagiru zyakuyi, toziya ali ndo lihengu lyakafiruwa kulitenda muntu. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Mana, Mlungu hakatozi matendu getu goseri, ata galii yagatendeka kwa bada, gaweri maheri ama madoda.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>